    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 205, 396, 90]
    contractRef: phases.phase-3.purpose
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 14
      text: |
        <p>Separate authentication from session validity, test what the credential change actually achieved, and use a benign comparator and the collection-coverage record to stop yourself over-reading the rest.</p>
  - elementId: urgency-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [500, 166, 396, 19]
